Z||000000||fieroshop||07-13-2000||11:40 AM||||I am happy to announce that Golden Gate Fieros will be hosting next years west fest fiero odyssey. This event will be held in San Leandro just minutes away from San Francisco. We plan a excursion to fishermans wharf on friday and then the show and shine will be held at waters edge since we will hosting the show at a marina. We will also have a tri bridge tour on Sunday with a lunch stop in Sausalito. I hope to see as many of you folks from the forum. ||||reg||6
Z||000001||WKDFIRO||07-13-2000||02:16 PM||||Count us in! <P>From the talk within Fieros West we are very excited in going. Let me know if there is anything we can do for you.||||reg||14
